    "detailed_description": "Koko, the Last Leaf, is a fantastical adventure and fighting game where you play as the last of the Leaf kind, seeking revenge against the evil Gods.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore a vast magical world</h2>Dive deep into the lush lands of the children of the Gods. Magical enemies and peculiar friends await you in this colorful and surprising world.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967980/extras/e38c91adb3c5bc3773a1542eb79e7775.poster.avif?t=1650549843\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967980/extras/e38c91adb3c5bc3773a1542eb79e7775.webm?t=1650549843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967980/extras/e38c91adb3c5bc3773a1542eb79e7775.mp4?t=1650549843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fight for revenge</h2>Battle, outwit, and defeat the bosses and unique enemies that lay scattered throughout the world. Seek out those who have destroyed your kin and deliver vengeance with a swift hand.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967980/extras/aba464a4232397838332dac39fc5a71a.poster.avif?t=1650549843\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967980/extras/aba464a4232397838332dac39fc5a71a.webm?t=1650549843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967980/extras/aba464a4232397838332dac39fc5a71a.mp4?t=1650549843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Use the power of the Gods</h2>Discover magical abilities that allow you to draw upon the power of the Gods. These abilities will allow you to explore deeper, learn secrets, and grow stronger.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967980/extras/4f11a23a83f8f1d240c30fc22436fff7.poster.avif?t=1650549843\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967980/extras/4f11a23a83f8f1d240c30fc22436fff7.webm?t=1650549843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967980/extras/4f11a23a83f8f1d240c30fc22436fff7.mp4?t=1650549843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unravel the mysteries of the past</h2>As you explore, discover hints to unfold the story of the Leaf kind\u2019s destruction. The secrets you unearth will guide you in your journey and reveal disturbing truths about the Gods.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967980/extras/8c4754cc1ff2eacd03c7e1c5ea2eb10e.poster.avif?t=1650549843\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967980/extras/8c4754cc1ff2eacd03c7e1c5ea2eb10e.webm?t=1650549843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967980/extras/8c4754cc1ff2eacd03c7e1c5ea2eb10e.mp4?t=1650549843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Precise 2D platforming</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Satisfying and challenging combat with skills and abilities that will aid your fighting</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hand-drawn pixel art animation</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Metroidvania qualities that reward exploration</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A large world with magical secrets, friends and foes</li></ul>",
