grow stronger.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967980/extras/4f11a23a83f8f1d240c30fc22436fff7.poster.avif?t=1650549843\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967980/extras/4f11a23a83f8f1d240c30fc22436fff7.webm?t=1650549843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967980/extras/4f11a23a83f8f1d240c30fc22436fff7.mp4?t=1650549843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unravel the mysteries of the past</h2>As you explore, discover hints to unfold the story of the Leaf kind\u2019s destruction. The secrets you unearth will guide you in your journey and reveal disturbing truths about the Gods.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967980/extras/8c4754cc1ff2eacd03c7e1c5ea2eb10e.poster.avif?t=1650549843\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967980/extras/8c4754cc1ff2eacd03c7e1c5ea2eb10e.webm?t=1650549843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967980/extras/8c4754cc1ff2eacd03c7e1c5ea2eb10e.mp4?t=1650549843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Precise 2D platforming</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Satisfying and challenging combat with skills and abilities that will aid your fighting</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hand-drawn pixel art animation</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Metroidvania qualities that reward exploration</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A large world with magical secrets, friends and foes</li></ul>",
